# Overlays inside modals

PrimeNG dialogs clip overlays. A `p-select`, `p-multiselect`, `p-datepicker`, `p-autocomplete`, or `p-menu` inside `p-dialog` draws its panel inside the dialog, and the dialog’s overflow cuts it off at the bottom.

Attach the panel to the document:

```html
<p-multiselect
  [options]="options"
  appendTo="body"
  styleClass="w-full"
/>
```

Same attribute on `p-select`, `p-datepicker`, `p-autocomplete`, and `p-menu`.

Do not set the dialog content to `overflow: visible` to work around this. The dialog still needs to scroll. `appendTo="body"` is the fix.
